note preset
; @pos 113 -65
; STG CRSNDO - ROM4A voice 19
; Copy of keyboardController6OperatorFMSynth.
; Hold a Janko keyboard note to hear the swell.
; Release the key to start the release envelope.
; Stereo reverb is copied from reverbGrouped.
; Its exposed sliders control decay, amount, diffusion and damping.
;
; Algorithm 2: [2 feedback] -> 1 -> output
;             6 -> 5 -> 4 -> 3 -> output
; Feedback 7 on OP2; oscillator sync on.
; Coarse ratios OP1..6: 1, 1, 1, 1, 2, 4.
; Fine tuning is zero for every operator.
; Detune OP1..6: -1, +7, +7, 0, 0, 0.
; Envelope rates and levels below are raw 0..99.
; Rate scaling and velocity sensitivity are zero.
; All left key depths and all AM sensitivities are zero.
; Only OP3 has right scaling: breakpoint B5, depth 99, -LIN.
; Pitch EG rates: 84, 95, 95, 60; levels: 50, 50, 50, 50.
; Pitch EG is neutral; transpose is zero.
; LFO: sine, speed 35, delay 73, PMD 14, AMD 0, PMS 1, sync off.
;
; Monophonic floating-point approximation at 48 kHz.
; Envelope/LFO calibration reference (Apache-2.0):
; github.com/google/music-synthesizer-for-android
; This does not reproduce the DX7 DAC or fixed-point engine.
noteEnd

